# The vendored sign-in surface: sha256 of each copy, and the source it came from.
# This is the check that runs everywhere, including CI, where the site checkout does not exist.
# When the checkout IS present the suite also compares bytes against it and fails on drift.
# Regenerate after re-vendoring:  shasum -a 256 <copy>  (see desktop/vendor/launcher/README.md)
